    {
      "name": "Listing",
      "docs": [
        "A meme put on a stall, PDA `[\"listing\", stall, mint]`.",
        "",
        "The record is never deleted. Withdrawing sets `Withdrawn` rather than closing",
        "the account, so a stall cannot erase a call it no longer likes."
